WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
This video will end with our ascension of Ashina Castle

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.840
But our story begins many years before that

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.240
It begins before wolf was assigned to be the Divine Prince's shinobi

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.640
Before he was plucked from the battlefield by his father

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:14.900
We have to go back

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.400
Even before Isshin of Ashina founded this nation

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.520
All the way back to a people who loved the ancient land

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.700
they lived upon

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.300
Isshin: Before this land was a place where we

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.900
The Ashina people lived

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:31.620
Where the waters flowed straight from the source

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.700
We were a people who loved our country dearly

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.000
But we were heretics

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.600
And we were weak

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.760
Naturally we were overrun

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:41.920
Trampled!

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:43.460
Into submission

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.120
For many long excruciating years

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:50.500
We couldn't even pray at the water from the springs

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:54.440
The way we were then

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.200
Sekiro: But then the world fell into chaos

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.500
Could you... tell me about the rebellion?

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:05.120
Isshin: We just took back what was stolen from us.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.960
Amidst the chaos that was Japan

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.380
The endless casualties

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.320
The flames of war

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:16.720
We found the perfect opportunity to take back our land

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:22.380
General Tamuraaaa!!

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:23.060
IS

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:23.620
NO

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:25.220
MORE!!!!!

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:27.940
Isshin, the Sword Saint of the Ashina

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:29.780
Turned the tide in the rebellion

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:31.660
A devil with the sword

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:34.520
His technique was eagerly polished in the blood of his enemies

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.800
And.. his single-minded search for strength

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.280
And did with him securing Ashina's independence once more

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:44.700
Pivotal in Isshin's coup were his Seven Spears

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:47.680
Of whom, very few remain in game

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:49.540
And of course, his generals

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:52.480
Everyone one of them accomplished, in the now famous

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:53.920
Ashina Sword Style

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.660
And in the aftermath of the rebellion

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:59.640
An owl pluck a starving wolf from the battlefield

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:02.380
Owl: Well would you look at that

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:03.680
Fascinating

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.780
Will you join me, starving wolf?

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:10.420
A hunger may beget a fine shinobi

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.020
Making us a worthy right hand

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:16.020
And someone utterly loyal to our foster father

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:17.740
And to this end

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:20.260
We are eventually assigned a prestigious role

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.840
Shinobi to Kuro

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.080
A young child

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:25.780
Who is an heir to a Divine Bloodline

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.480
Owl: As your father, my will is absolute

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.060
Your master's is a close second

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:35.040
It's possible that this scene

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:37.380
Where we're tasked with the Divine Heir's protection

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:40.060
Takes place in the Hirata Estate

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.460
This is an abundant track of land

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:44.700
That was likely owned by Kuro's uncle

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:47.340
Who would likely have taken him in

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:48.960
After the death of his mother

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:49.820
and father

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.160
and uncle

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:51.900
We never meet

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.180
For everyone around the Divine Heir

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:55.480
seems to die

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:58.300
I tried my best to be his guardian but...

00:02:58.680 --> 00:02:59.180
*sigh*

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:00.740
Look at me now

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:02.960
Three years before the start of the game

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:05.620
The Hirata are raided by a swarm of bandits

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:08.080
They all attacked with perfect timing

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.540
When all of the young soldiers are out fighting

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:13.440
Likely on behalf of the Ashina in their war

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:16.500
So only the older warriors remain here

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:18.460
To protect the Divine Heir

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:19.660
HEAR ME!

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:20.640
MY

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:21.140
NAME

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:21.660
IS

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:22.960
NOGAMI GENSAI!!!

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.540
I STOOD WITH THE ASHINA

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:27.740
WHEN THEY CLAIMED THIS LAND

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:30.760
The Hirata are a cadet branch of the Ashina

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:33.900
They share a really long history with the clan

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:38.220
And here, three years before the events of the main game

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:40.640
That long history ends

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:41.420
And you

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:43.120
were not by your Prince's side

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:43.860
You...

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:46.620
You're the young master's shinobi!

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:48.220
What good are you?

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:51.700
You were no where to be seen when things went south!

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:54.240
Protecting Kuro is your second rule

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.540
But your first loyalty is to your Father

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.360
So it follows that your father

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.400
Must have sent you away from Hirata

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.420
In order for the attack to succeed

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:03.140
*inhales*

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:05.860
After all, this bandit attack was his idea

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:09.080
Taking the Hirata Estate was surprisingly easy

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:11.960
Owl's info was right on the money, you know?

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:15.200
The man Juzou is talking to is Masanari

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:16.780
A lone shadow

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.320
of the Interior Ministry

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.680
And you can think of the Interior Ministry

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:23.700
As a sort of Central Government force in Japan

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:26.460
It's a force that appears to have come out on top

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:29.720
Of Japan's Sengoku era conflict; and

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:33.180
Now they have the Ashina clan on their hitlist

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:35.000
The bandits are simply a means to an end

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.300
They're a way for the Interior Ministry to

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:39.400
strike a blow against the Ashina

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:42.200
And mask the Interior Ministry's involvement

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.360
He's a villain

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.400
A down run out villain, Masanari

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:46.540
Well

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:48.360
He's useful right now

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.520
So adore him

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:50.880
For all this scheming

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:53.360
He's a nameless rogue shinobi

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.780
His efforts won't amount him much

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:57.000
Sekiro: Father??

00:04:57.780 --> 00:04:58.500
Uughhh

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:00.080
It's you

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:01.760
I'm afraid I...

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:03.540
made a bit of a

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:04.140
blunder

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:08.480
Perhaps the years have finally caught up with me

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:09.420
AaarRrrgggh

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:10.700
Wolf...

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.120
Protect your master

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:14.340
With

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:16.600
your life...

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:18.340
Owl fakes his death

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:21.820
Now able to operate fully in the shadows

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:25.120
While you build a stronger connection with the Divine Heir

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:27.700
By rescuing him from this nightmare

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:29.180
My Lord

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:32.500
It's been a long time

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:35.920
Son of Owl

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.680
This is Phantom Butterfly

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:41.280
A Master of Illusions

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.880
Who trained you

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.540
in the Shinobi Arts at Owl's request

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.140
Owl's real name is

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:48.140
[Ukonzaemon] Usui

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:50.320
And Lady Butterfly herself

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.160
Trained in Usui's forest

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:53.800
A place far to the north

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.560
Filled with mist and mystifications

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:58.760
She trained you since you were a cub

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:00.680
And with her dying breath

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:03.240
She finally acknowledges your growth

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.060
Sekiro: Lady Butterfly...

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:05.960
Forgive me...

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:07.820
You've...

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:10.900
gotten stronger...

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:12.800
Wolf...

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.380
Owl's ultimate goal

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:16.480
is Immortality

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:18.740
The power of the Dragon's Heritage

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:22.700
It's a power held by Kuro that can be transferred to another

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:24.780
Kuro has lost his mother

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:25.840
He has lost father

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:26.540
his uncle

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:27.220
his clan

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:28.900
And now...

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:30.520
He has lost his shinobi

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:31.660
as well

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.420
Who just so happens to be

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.820
Owl's loyal cub

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.520
Kuro: you've fought bravely...!

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:38.280
on my behalf...

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.220
I cannot throw away such loyalty!

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:48.820
Loyal Wolf

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:50.000
Take my blood

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:50.600
And live

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:51.220
Again

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.920
It's my theory that

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:58.640
Owl clear out the Hirata Estates

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:00.880
And might have even killed Kuro's mother and father

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:04.180
In order to increase Kuro's reliance on us

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:06.740
By extension, Owl as well

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:09.740
An indeterminable amount of time passes

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:11.660
You're awaken in a well

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.080
Deep within Ashina lands

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:14.120
Wounded

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.480
With little memory of recent events

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:19.780
A single sakura petal falls

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:22.940
Representing a rebirth that we must have experienced here

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:25.680
This is the power of the Dragon's Heritage

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:28.320
The power that Owl, Lady Butterfly, and

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.520
now, Lord Genichiro

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:32.680
crave for their own ends

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:34.660
Imprisoning a mere child

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:36.480
I feel sorry for the boy

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:37.380
Agreed

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:40.340
But I'm sure Lord Genichiro has his reasons

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:43.080
Lord Genichiro now leads the Ashina clan

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.520
In his grandfather's stead

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.580
For Isshin is old

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:47.420
Ailing

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:51.180
Apparently he's not too keen to keep a child locked up

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:54.520
Kuro: There's a secret passage beneath the moat bridge

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:55.840
that will take us out of the castle

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:58.180
Lord Isshin told me about it once

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:03.320
So with our sword, Kusabimaru, an heirloom of the Hirata family

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:06.900
And Kuro, one of their last living members by our side

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:08.960
We attempt to flee Ashina

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.640
And abandon all allegiance to this country

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:13.020
But it was not to be

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:14.500
Genichiro: The Divine Heir

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:18.060
Last we stood together was your uncle's funeral

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.280
As mentioned earlier,

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:22.240
Kuro's uncle was of the Hirata

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:25.180
A man who took him in after the death of his parents

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:28.260
By mentioning their shared presence at the funeral

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:32.060
Genichiro is reminding Kuro of his blood ties to the Ashina

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:34.280
And shaming him for

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.920
the fealty to country and kin

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:38.320
that he is shirking

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:39.480
To Genichiro

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:41.500
That fealty is everything

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:44.340
For Genichiro was actually born a peasant

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.900
Taken in by the Ashina

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.340
After his mother's death

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:53.060
There's an astounding amount of parent-child complexes in Sekiro

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:56.400
And it wouldn't surprise if Genichiro thought of this country

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:58.700
As a substitute for his own mother in a way

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.420
He owes everything to this country

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.760
He constantly says how

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:05.980
he goes to any ends to protect her

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:08.740
Once more, you're defeated through treachery

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:09.840
except this time

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:12.200
You awaken in a Dilapidated temple

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:15.700
A Buddhist sculptor dragged you here from the field

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:17.100
And he nurse you back to health

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:19.540
He feigns this disinterest in you

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:24.360
But he portrays a sincere knowledge and empathy of your situation

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:27.960
Sculptor: he's being held prisoner in Ashina castle

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:31.060
they will soon make use of his bloodline

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.520
Looking at you

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:36.400
I'm sure you appreciate the value it has

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:40.320
Here too, is the woman with the red umbrella

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:42.420
That bid us to rise from the well

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:46.540
My name is Emma, I am a doctor serving a certain master

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:47.660
Sekiro: what master?

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:49.620
Emma: forgive me but

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:50.960
for his safety

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.320
I cannot reveal his identity

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.600
The master she serves is Lord Isshin

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:00.520
Who is, again, the now old man who once brought the Ashina to glory

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:05.580
And while it's true that Isshin is allied with his grandson Genichiro

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:08.480
He still directs his healer to assist you

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:10.060
in retrieving the prince

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.880
Making no effort to cut you down

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:15.500
Even in moments where he clearly could

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:17.020
The truth is

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.380
Isshin cares about the Ashina

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:22.660
Insofar as his own skills can allow him to save it

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:26.380
He cares about a good fight above all else

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:29.540
He will not abandon his own self

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:30.720
His own soul

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:32.300
In pursuit of power

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:36.020
For using such a power as the Dragon's Heritage

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.620
comes at a great cost

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:38.920
Dragonrot

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:44.600
An epidemic that spreads to those you've been in contact with stagnating their life force

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.920
So that your life force can thrive

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:50.840
And this is a story that has played out once before long ago

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:54.860
Emma: There was a Dragonrot epidemic in Ashina once before

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:58.320
Back then... a cure was not achieved

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:02.380
Every single person who caught it died

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:05.460
And the time since you defeat Genichiro

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:06.820
Your Divine Heir has been

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:10.000
Wrestling with this burden of his power

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.060
Genichiro: We managed to drive them back once

00:11:12.140 --> 00:11:12.640
But

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:16.060
the Interior Ministry's army's power is far too powerful

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:19.740
Kuro: and that is why you wish to use the power of my blood

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:22.920
it doesn't matter how much power you obtain

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:26.280
You'll keep on fighting until you're a monster

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:30.380
Incapable of feeling pain or fear

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:32.560
I do not wish to corrupt the lives of men

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:34.980
Genichiro: look at this mountain of bodies

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:37.720
Ashina cannot be defended by normal means

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:39.940
Not anymore...

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:45.980
Kuro: I could never be as strong as you Lord Genichiro

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:49.780
I do not yet know what it is that I should do

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.200
As you follow Kuro's remnants

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:54.160
leading towards Ashina castle

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:57.940
You realize just how beaten and bruised the Ashina are

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.900
As the Interior Ministry steadily wears them down

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:03.180
As Isshin falls to his illnesss

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:07.540
And with Kuro refusing to grant the Ashina the power of his blood

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:09.460
Something had to be done instead

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:15.420
A taro troop of physically enhanced but vacant brutes are forced into battle

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:18.400
Not to mention a bull fitted with a blazing totem

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:22.520
Troops and generals patrol the landscape endlessly and

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:24.900
You cut them all down in Kuro's name

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:31.840
In those small way, you single-handedly make it very easy for the Ashina to be invaded

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:37.100
As it stands, the wave of Interior Ministry troops are breaking upon one-

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:37.660
MY!!!

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:38.940
NAAAAAAAAMMMEEE

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:39.440
IS

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:40.000
GYOUBU

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:40.840
MASATAKA

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.500
ONIWAAAAAAAAA!!!!

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.440
AS I BREATH

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.000
YOU

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:46.500
WILL

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:47.000
NOT

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:47.500
PASS

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.200
THE CASTLE GATE

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:50.920
Gyoubu the Demon

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:53.280
A retainer to Lord Genichiro

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:56.000
But he was not always allied with the Ashina

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:59.740
In fact he was once an infamous bandit chief within these lands

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:02.240
But then Isshin defeated him

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:04.800
And he was impressed by his strength

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:08.440
That he awarded him the spear of General Tamura

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:09.880
Who you saw before

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:13.400
And convinced Gyoubu to fight for the Ashina instead

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:18.540
With his death, you destroyed the last real defense leading to Ashina Castle

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:22.280
That is, except for an old man within the adjacent watchtower

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:28.940
A man with a talent for killing rats and he is one who knows much about Ashina Sword Arts

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:31.400
Tengu: care to hunt some rats with me?

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:32.180
Sekiro: what?

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:33.220
Tengu: rats

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:34.900
Have snuck into Ashina

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:38.720
Scurrying about like they own the place

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:40.320
and they must be cut down!

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:42.380
EVERY LAST ONE OF THEM

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.060
War is on the horizon

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:48.500
a dreadful one at that it will give birth to a demon

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.700
I'm certain of it!

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:57.120
The dead will rise as mountains and the hate will flow like an inferno

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:59.160
But it is all to get your prince back

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:02.800
And despite the endless entreaties of Genichiro

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:10.340
And the suffering of the Ashina at every turn, Kuro never once lost faith that you would return

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:14.980
Kuro: he will risk his life to take me home

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:17.700
For he...

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.380
is my shinobi

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:27.960
Sekiro: my lord, I have come for you

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.220
This...

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:37.640
...will only take a moment.

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:47.180
Genichiro: I see

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:50.940
For as long as you are alive

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:54.820
The Dragon's blood can never be mine

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:57.400
Genichiro is best kind of villain

00:14:57.400 --> 00:15:01.980
He's the sort that commits evil in pursuit of a single-minded purpose

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:04.040
Not unlike you, really

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:07.580
You.. who spread Dragonrot to keep your prince safe

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:12.420
You.. who murder hundred Ashina soldiers simply fighting for their land

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:17.820
Genichiro truly believe that Ashina cannot be saved through normal means

00:15:17.820 --> 00:15:20.660
And he risk everything by antagonizing you

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:25.100
Clinging to this faint hope of being granted Kuro's power

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:28.180
Genichiro: impressive! Shinobi of the Divine Heir

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:31.920
But you deserved better

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:35.720
Would you not answer to a different lord,

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:38.600
Heresy

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:44.300
Heresy you say?

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:49.360
If it's for the sake of preserving Ashina

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:57.160
I will cease any manner of heretical strength

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:59.620
I will endure any burden

00:16:03.220 --> 00:16:05.920
Behold the lightning of Tomoe

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:15.740
Lady Tomoe was Genichiro's mentor

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:21.920
She was a master of the sword who descended to Ashina bearing many heretical arts

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:28.020
And often Genichiro could be spotted in the courtyard behind the castle practicing his swordplay

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:31.920
All the while glaring at the lightning roiling in the clouds

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:38.360
Tomoe is an immensely important character who I actually fully expect to have her on DLC

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:42.540
But we'll touch on her and what we'll know about her on the next video

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:45.720
Ashi... na...

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:50.200
&gt;w&lt;

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.260
Emma: Lord Genichiro!

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:58.240
Is this the Rejuvenating Waters?

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:11.900
Genichiro: Ashina... this land is everything to me

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:14.800
For her sake

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:21.300
I will shed humanity itself

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.480
Resurrection?

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.380
Yes

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:33.220
Indeed

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:42.480
So long

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:53.120
Note that both Isshin and Genichiro never say they fight for Ashina's people. No.

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:55.040
The fight for Ashina's land

00:17:55.400 --> 00:18:02.040
One small part of Ashina is exceedingly old after all and the ancient soil, rocks and water

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:05.140
Are said to have attracted the attention of the gods

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:12.300
Add to this,  the fact that the Dragon's Heritage was set free from its homeland and drifted here to Japan

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:17.760
And we realized that there is certainly an ancient origin story here somewhere that we are missing

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:21.060
It's something that Genichiro and Isshin likely know

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:26.080
For they are unwilling to accept anything other than total ownership

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:30.200
both of the land and the water that runs through it

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:36.500
Emma: to think that Lord Genichiro would go as far as to drink the Rejuvenating Sediment.

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.360
Sekiro: Rejuvenating Sediment?

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:44.140
That's what we call a particularly concentrated part of the Rejuvenating Waters

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:46.700
I'm sure you saw it for yourself

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:48.800
The Rejuvenating Waters

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:53.140
They flow from the Divine Realm all the way through  Ashina's lands

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:55.100
But it seems like they weren't meant for this land

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:59.880
Drink them and you may inherit an echo of Kuro's immortality

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:02.000
At the risk of your own humanity

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:07.080
Emma: the Rejuvenating Sediment grants great resilience in one's flesh

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:12.620
One becomes able to withstand blows that would be fatal to anyone else

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:24.060
My mentor Dogen, devoted much research to its uses but all of his works, document, medicines, everything

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:25.860
Were burned and destroyed

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:27.520
I'm not sure who

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:35.300
But I heard one of the senior apprentices was able to salvage some of it, probably Doujun

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:40.260
And deep below Ashina castle, in a long abandoned dungeon, full of undying men

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:45.020
One of Emma's fellow disciples, Doujun, researches the waters

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.940
For the glory of Ashina

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:49.340
They led us in on many discoveries

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:56.500
But one is that red-eyes commonly manifest in those who are unable to achieve their desires and considering

00:19:56.540 --> 00:20:04.660
there are Hirata soldiers guarding both ends of the cave and that the results of these experiments fight for the Ashina

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:09.400
It's pretty clear that Genichiro was invested in this research

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:15.580
Furthermore, according to the Ministry Dousing Powder, we learn that the Interior Ministry feared Ashina

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:19.440
Her eyes, bloodshot with the Waters of Rejuvenation

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:21.760
Kuro: Lady Emma, tell me...

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:24.760
What has caused the state of this man?

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:28.100
Emma: the Rejuvenating Waters, that is what it is called.

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:31.400
Are you telling me that this is Ashina's secret weapon?

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:32.280
I am

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:38.580
Those who drink it cannot fully die. No. They become unable to die at all.

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:42.280
The Rejuvenating Water, it also-

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:44.380
It springs from the Dragon's blood

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:45.440
Does it not?

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:46.060
Yes

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:47.380
Lady Emma...

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:51.180
I do not believe the Dragon's blood is sacred

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.200
Not at all

00:20:53.840 --> 00:21:00.040
It's no surprise then, that when we next meet with Kuro, he no longer wishes to abandon Ashina

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:06.920
Instead, he's grown. He's taken on the immense responsibility of his power and now he aims to sever

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:07.620
immortality

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.320
No matter the cost

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:15.420
In those small ways, it was probably the desperation of Genichiro that led him to this conclusion

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:20.460
And you can tell that he even harbors some regrets about resurrecting you

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.900
Sekiro: I have come for you, my lord

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:23.760
Kuro: Yes

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:25.620
You did well to come here

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:26.620
Let us go

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:28.140
We must leave Ashina

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:35.360
Wolf, my blood, the blood of the Dragon causes men to become undying

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:36.940
The same goes for you

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.280
Yes, my lord

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:39.980
I wish to save you!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:43.720
I'm sure that I would do the same thing given another chance

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:44.780
However

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:47.460
Undying begets stagnation

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:48.940
The Immortal Oath

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:51.060
The Rejuvenating Waters

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:52.740
The Dragonrot

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:54.900
They all corrupt men

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:58.020
to the point where they no longer live as men

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:02.900
I wish to severe the chains of stagnation bred by the Dragon's Heritage

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:03.900
Wolf

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:06.900
Will you help me achieve this aim

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:14.320
The only way to absolve that guilt of resurrecting you is to use you to relinquish his power all-together

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:20.160
The quest for that goal is long and it's complicated but it's super rewarding  to understand

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:21.920
And it's a story for the next video

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:25.180
Honestly it's a story we're gonna be telling for months! :D

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:30.640
As Sekiro is definitely more complicated that many people are giving credit for

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:33.960
And after that we'll dive into the endings

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:36.320
What circumstances lead to those endings?

00:22:36.780 --> 00:22:39.420
Where can story go after those endings?

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:46.320
Finally, in every FromSoftware game there is lore that can only really be pieced together through context

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:51.080
And the relationships between different parts of the story, this is the hidden lore

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:56.440
the stories that have yet to be told and probably will be told in the DLC to come

00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:00.060
And then, it will be time for Shadows Cry Twice

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:05.020
Head deep dives into some of the best characters that FromSoftware have ever written

00:23:05.640 --> 00:23:10.180
So subscribe and consider checking out the Patreon if you're interested into becoming a deeper

00:23:10.180 --> 00:23:11.500
member of this community

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:14.260
There's so much to cover in the months to come

00:23:14.300 --> 00:23:15.820
So let's figure it all out

00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:16.440
Together

00:23:16.440 --> 00:23:17.780
And we'll see you next time

